{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1443445-solar-awareness-rewrite","id":1443445,"title":"Solar Awareness rewrite","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-11T00:04:22-07:00","id":1443445,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Solar Awareness rewrite","content":"I decided to give remaking Awareness a stab. Not only did I streamline the set and make charms clearer, but I provided some proper rules and codifications to Awareness and senses in general. I\u2019ve also included a few new awareness charms, including a combat section to give additional combat utility and usefulness to Awareness in general. Being an Awareness Supernal now isn\u2019t that bad of a thing anymore.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G6YAQg493MBsHtRAwJ6kvughI3nVj5pc7yS4zHQX2lc/edit#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G6YAQg493MBsHtRAwJ6kvughI3nVj5pc7yS4zHQX2lc/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G6YAQg493MBsHtRAwJ6kvughI3nVj5pc7yS4zHQX2lc/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G6YAQg493MBsHtRAwJ6kvughI3nVj5pc7yS4zHQX2lc/edit# </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T11:44:32-07:00","id":1443487,"title":"","content":"It's a little vague on what is the benefits of Superhuman senses. The text mentions that the difficulties may be lower in some cases, but there are no more details nor guidelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T13:17:03-07:00","id":1443499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pcontop</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1443445-solar-awareness-rewrite?p=1443487#post1443487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a little vague on what is the benefits of Superhuman senses. The text mentions that the difficulties may be lower in some cases, but there are no more details nor guidelines.</div> </div> </div> </div>Details of it and magical senses are in the table. Basically to make out fine details on someone at extreme range is going to require superhuman sight. If you get a really good mundane roll you could determine if someone is a soldier wearing armour, but with superhuman sight you'd be able to make out the insignia of which army they belong to. Trying to spot something beyond a certain difficulty requires Superhuman or magical senses to even attempt it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T14:28:10-07:00","id":1443507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1443445-solar-awareness-rewrite?p=1443499#post1443499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Details of it and magical senses are in the table. Basically to make out fine details on someone at extreme range is going to require superhuman sight. If you get a really good mundane roll you could determine if someone is a soldier wearing armour, but with superhuman sight you'd be able to make out the insignia of which army they belong to. Trying to spot something beyond a certain difficulty requires Superhuman or magical senses to even attempt it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I've found only one example for superhuman in one category:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Superhuman </b>or magical senses required to make out any meaningful detail on an object. Visual aids (such as telescopes) may allow such rolls (EX: You can still someone at this distance, but need superhuman senses to make out more than just a dot). Read a book by feeling the letters on the paper. Seeing fine details on something the size of a grain of sand. Telling identical twins apart.</span></span> </div> </div> </div>This is mixed up with magical senses, so I don't have one example of what just superhuman perception can do. And even the table gives no example, again, of what level of difficulty reduction would happen when using the charms. It's better than the handwave we got in the official charms, but it could be detailed better.<br /> <br /> edit - BTW, I got some typos and stuff in your charm, but I couldn't add suggestions. Couldn't you enable suggestions as you did in the other charm rewrites?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T14:55:19-07:00","id":1443515,"title":"","content":"I see what you mean. Part of me was thinking about how to see fine details of something of something human-sized, tiny-sized, and minuscule-sized at range. Another reason is that I still wanted some level of base success. My rule of thumb is that anything past 5 is going to need Superhuman senses at minimum, while even at 5 you'll need superhuman in order to make things out with anything beyond broad strokes.<br /> <br /> I'll need to think on it a bit more. Maybe I'll figure out a way after a fresh perspective.<br /> <br /> Also comments are on now. I forgot to turn them on before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}